          "summary": "Add TrueLink defence obligation and IP infringement, breach of law, data breach and gross negligence/wilful misconduct indemnities, plus standard indemnity procedure.",
          "comment": "[Playbook] TrueLink's indemnity in Section 12(b) covers only its own breach of the Agreement and contains no protection against third-party intellectual property infringement claims arising from the Interface or hosted services, which our playbook treats as a critical requirement given we are licensing and reselling TrueLink's technology. We have added a duty to defend and indemnities for IP infringement, breach of law, unauthorised disclosure of Client data and gross negligence/wilful misconduct, together with a standard notice, control and cooperation procedure; if preferred, we can accept the usual IP indemnity exclusions (Client modifications, combinations and specifications) and procure/modify/replace/refund remedies.",
