              "oldText": "TrueLink shall indemnify and hold Client harmless",
              "newText": "TrueLink shall defend, indemnify and hold Client harmless"
            },
            {
              "kind": "replace",
              "paragraphId": "p0075",
              "oldText": "claim arising out of any breach by TrueLink of this Agreement or any failure by TrueLink in the performance of any of its obligations or agreements hereunder.",
              "newText": "claim (i) arising out of any breach by TrueLink of this Agreement or any failure by TrueLink in the performance of any of its obligations or agreements hereunder, (ii) alleging that the Interface, the Hosting Services, the Support Services or any other materials or services provided by TrueLink infringe or misappropriate any patent, copyright, trademark, trade secret or other intellectual property right of any third party, (iii) arising out of TrueLink's breach of any applicable law, rule or regulation, (iv) arising out of any unauthorized access to or disclosure of Client Content or Client or customer data caused by TrueLink, or (v) arising out of TrueLink's gross negligence or willful misconduct. The indemnified party shall give the indemnifying party prompt written notice of any claim for which indemnity is sought, and the indemnifying party shall have control of the defense and settlement of such claim (provided that no settlement imposing any liability or obligation on the indemnified party shall be made without its prior written consent), with the reasonable cooperation of the indemnified party at the indemnifying party's expense."
            }
